         "boxed": false,
         "children": [
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "What Is Custom Logo Design?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p><strong>Custom logo design</strong> means a designer creates a logo specifically for your business, starting from a blank canvas. Unlike a logo generator or template, a custom logo is built around your name, your industry and your customers, so it is original and can be protected as your brand.</p><p>At Logo Austin, each custom logo is designed in Adobe Illustrator as a vector graphic. That makes it sharp at any size and easy to adapt for printing, signage, embroidery and the web.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
