         "children": [
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "How a Custom Logo Is Developed",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ol><li><strong>Share your vision.</strong> Tell the designers your business name, slogan, industry and any colors, symbols or logos you like or dislike.</li><li><strong>Initial concepts.</strong> Designers create multiple distinct concepts, often within hours, each exploring a different direction.</li><li><strong>Choose a direction.</strong> You select the concept closest to your vision. Parts of different concepts can be combined.</li><li><strong>Revisions.</strong> Fonts, colors, icon details and layout are adjusted based on your feedback until the logo is final.</li><li><strong>Final logo package.</strong> You pay after approval and receive the complete file set and full ownership.</li></ol>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
