         "children": [
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Types of Logos We Design",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Choosing the right logo type depends on your name, industry and where the logo will be used most.</p><div><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Logo Type</th><th scope=\"col\">What It Is</th><th scope=\"col\">Works Well For</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Wordmark</strong></td><td>The business name in a distinctive font</td><td>Short, memorable names; professional services</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Lettermark / Monogram</strong></td><td>Initials designed as a mark</td><td>Long names; law, finance, real estate</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Icon + Wordmark</strong></td><td>A symbol paired with the name</td><td>Most small businesses; new brands</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Emblem / Badge</strong></td><td>Text inside a shape or crest</td><td>Restaurants, breweries, schools, apparel</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Mascot</strong></td><td>An illustrated character</td><td>Sports, food, gaming and kids' brands</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
