          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Logo Strategy: Positioning and Brand Features",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>A custom logo should communicate how your business wants to be seen. Designers consider <strong>positioning</strong> (premium, affordable, friendly, technical), the <strong>brand features</strong> customers should notice, and how the logo will be used across digital and printed materials.</p><p>The goal is a logo that is simple, efficient and attractive: easy to recognize, easy to reproduce and right for your market.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
