          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Custom Logo Design FAQs",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How much does a custom logo cost at Logo Austin?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Custom logo design at Logo Austin is priced from $125 to $175, depending on the complexity of the design. There is no upfront charge: you review the concepts and pay only when you are satisfied.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How many logo concepts will I receive?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Logo Austin provides multiple distinct concepts at the start of every custom logo project so you can compare directions before choosing one to refine.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How many revisions are included?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Revisions continue until you are satisfied with the logo. Because payment is due only after approval, the design is finished when you say it is.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "What file formats are included?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Final logos are delivered in JPG, PNG (transparent background), PDF, SVG, AI and EPS formats, so the same logo works on websites, social media, business cards, signs, apparel and print.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Do I own the final logo?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin provides complete ownership of the final logo design along with the editable source files, and can assist with copyright paperwork.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can my logo be used on shirts and embroidered hats?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Vector files work for screen printing, and Logo Austin can also prepare a DST file for embroidery.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
